Package: foceexecutorR
Title: Execute a Signed Population-PK Model Descriptor Against a Pluggable Backend
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Intelligent", "Analytics", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "sahmed_ai@intanalytic.com"),
    person("Intelligent Analytics", role = "cph"))
Description: Takes the signed 'model.json' descriptor emitted by the sentinel-poppk
    workflow at report sign-off and executes the model it specifies against a
    pluggable estimation backend. Backends are registered rather than hard-coded,
    so the same descriptor can be run against a fast approximate estimator for a
    preview or against NONMEM for an official result. This package owns execution
    only: assembling data, imputation and BLQ handling, and organising outputs are
    the orchestrator's job, not this one.
